    <string name="about">About Hearth</string>
    <string name="about_title">Hearth %1$s</string>
    <string name="about_body">A small Android launcher.\n\nVibe-coded: written largely by an AI model (Claude) under human direction and testing. Read the code before trusting it with anything important.\n\nFree software under the GNU GPL v3 or later. No ads, no analytics, no network access.</string>
